{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/z2tcnm5s","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":105.6,"width":864,"height":28.8},"name":"Text 2","text":"Challenge 1: Wrong medicine match","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yhkbe1o7","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":67.2,"top":139.2,"width":825.6,"height":62.4},"name":"Text 3","text":"Problem: similar names can refer to different medicines.\nMitigation: use exact matches first and require confirmation for ambiguity.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/l4bupwny","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":206.4,"width":864,"height":0.96},"name":"Shape 4","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#F5F5F5","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/032tgr6d","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":220.8,"width":864,"height":28.8},"name":"Text 5","text":"Challenge 2: Alert fatigue","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/n6dcr65o","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":67.2,"top":254.4,"width":825.6,"height":62.4},"name":"Text 6","text":"Problem: too many low-severity warnings can distract the clinician.\nMitigation: rank by severity, merge duplicates and measure excess alerts.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/m5kbi1oj","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":321.6,"width":864,"height":0.96},"name":"Shape 7","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#F5F5F5","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/w32dkbuh","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":336,"width":864,"height":28.8},"name":"Text 8","text":"Challenge 3: Incomplete clinical context","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x4vedgvm","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":67.2,"top":369.6,"width":825.6,"height":62.4},"name":"Text 9","text":"Problem: missing medicines or patient details limit the checks.\nMitigation: show missing context and limitations. Never declare the list safe.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","alignment":"left"}}
