{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kzmdova1","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":159,"top":167,"width":642,"height":273},"name":"Text 4","text":"PLANNED DEMO — prototype not yet built\n1. Load a supplied synthetic patient with mixed medicine names.\n2. Confirm uncertain matches and show prioritized safety alerts.\n3. Compare a serious-risk case with a case containing no flagged issue.\nPlanned evaluation: serious-issue recall, name-match accuracy,\nlow-severity alerts per patient and recall on 300 seeded near-misses.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","alignment":"left"}}
