{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gnmp4jqx","slideIndex":6,"text":"Source: official problem statement, https://be.innosmart.in/media/talentap/H4.%20The%20Medication%20Safety%20Second%20Pair%20of%20Eyes_2.pdf\nOfficial seven-slide template linked under this problem on the InnoSmart portal, reviewed 17 October 2026.\nThis is a proposed design. Implementation, testing and performance measurements are planned. Initial audience and adoption path are hypotheses, not measured market estimates. Build timing and permitted tools remain subject to organizer rules."}